      "padAxisAlignment": "Seat Back & Axis Alignment: Move the seat back to the rearmost position to maximize the seat's usable surface area. Have the client sit and align the lateral center of their knee joint with the machine's axis of rotation. Bring the back pad forward to make light contact with the lower back without pushing their knees forward of the axis. Calf Pad Placement: Adjust the calf pad to make snug contact with the lowest part of the back of the leg, positioned just above the Achilles tendon (above the heel) so that it does not contact the shoe.",
